  "description": "Alexander, who had come to the American West to manage the casino hotel, ships, and an old aquarium he had inherited, meets Lee Young-Won there as a one-night stand. After spotting Young-Won at a club and hearing from a bartender that he’s known for not being picky about his partners, he’s intrigued by his appearance, which is the exact opposite of the rumors, and seduces him, leading him back to his hotel room. Once they’re in bed, Alexander tries to comfort Young-Won as he bursts into tears, but when he suddenly falls asleep, he has no choice but to drift off beside him. However, when he wakes up, Alexander finds himself alone, and he’s left feeling bewildered by this unprecedented situation.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
